    "body": "This worker stopped before claiming and added the `blocked` label because `#2828` depends on `#2826`.\n\nThis worker checked `upstream/main` at `380c29b3c8406eb5e743e1dfdc258e7e35ead4b6`:\n- `OpType::RotaryFlow` and `OpParams::RotaryFlow` do not exist in `crates/app/src/operation/kinds.rs` or `crates/app/src/operation/params.rs`.\n- `crates/app/src/operation/generate.rs` has no `OpParams::RotaryFlow` arm.\n- `crates/app/src/stock_sim_rotary.rs` (`rotary_kind_lift`) matches only `OpParams::RotaryParallel`, `OpParams::RotaryContour`, and `OpParams::RotaryOffset`.\n- `crates/app/src/operation/rotary_gate.rs` (`stamp_spindle_c`) accepts only a boolean `unwinds` flag and passes `radial = false` to `cl::unwind_c`.\n- `crates/motion/src/multiaxis/rotary_flow.rs` does not exist.\n- `crates/cl/src/cl/rotary_unwind.rs` already implements `unwind_c(..., radial: bool)` with unit tests for `radial = true`.\n\nPrerequisite status:\n- Issue `#2826` (`OpType::RotaryFlow` app wiring) is open and unclaimed, with no open PR to stack on.\n- Issue `#2824` (`rotary_flow` motion kernel) is open and claimed (`2026-11-19T22:19Z`), with no open PR yet.\n- Issue `#2772` (stated rotary axis on helical models) is open and unclaimed, with no open PR yet.\n\nOpen-PR checks on expected files for `#2828`:\n- `crates/app/tests/rotary_field_parity.rs`: open PR `#2809`.\n- `crates/app/src/operation/generate.rs`: open PRs `#2822`, `#2716`, `#2714`, and `#2678`.\n- `crates/app/src/stock_sim_rotary.rs`, `crates/app/tests/common/rotary_bar.rs`, `crates/cl/src/cl/rotary_unwind.rs`, `crates/app/src/operation/rotary_gate.rs`, and `crates/app/tests/c_axis_unwind.rs`: no open PRs.\n\nThis worker made no claim, branch, worktree, code change, or test run.\n\nRemove `blocked` and resume `#2828` after `#2826` merges to `main` or opens a PR to stack on.\n",
