    "body": "fix on issue/2828-rotaryflow-parity · PR #4005 · pinned by cl::rotary_unwind::a_feed_retracts_arrival_at_rest_stays_a_clearance, operation::rotary_gate::tests::the_flow_unwinds_on_the_retract_cylinder, rotary_flow_band::the_millturns_spindle_c_unwinds_a_full_ring_band_at_its_radial_links (with the #906 unrated refusal and the narrow-travel refusal), rotary_field_parity::the_eye_draws_the_flow_kinds_band and the_column_verdict_refuses_every_rotary_kind_by_name · stacked on #3999 · merges at the next cut.\n\nThe parity lane the lift is gated on ran in release: 168 sphere-cut tops within 1.269e-5 of the law (bound 2.011e-5), 0 sign misses over 7,053 cell centres, 35,491 sub-chords, the eye 2,131 sub-chords in 3.0 s. No epsilon was widened. The readings are in docs/decisions/2828-rotaryflow-parity.md.",
